<section class="sub" id="status-ldc">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="section-num">LAND DEVELOPMENT CODE UPDATE</div>
<h2 class="section-title">Phase 1 adopted; Phase 2's first deliverable isn't public yet</h2>
<p class="section-note">Per the project's own phase framing at santafeldcupdate.org. This is a separate process from the General Plan Update above, running on its own timeline.</p>
</div>

<div class="steps">
<div class="step done"><span class="step-marker"></span><div class="step-body"><div class="step-top"><h3>Phase 1 — LDC Foundations</h3><span class="step-state">Adopted, late 2025</span></div><p>Rewrote Chapter 14 (the zoning/land-development code itself). Now in effect as part of the City's Code of Ordinances.</p></div></div>
<div class="step active"><span class="step-marker"></span><div class="step-body"><div class="step-top"><h3>Phase 2 — Substantive Code Updates</h3><span class="step-state">Active now, began Summer 2026</span></div><p>The site's own "We are here" marker sits at or just before the Framework Report below — the next deliverable, and not yet published.</p></div></div>
</div>

<div class="case-study-list" style="margin-top:22px;">

<article class="card case-study" id="ldc-phase1">
<div class="card-top">
<h3>Phase 1 — Chapter 14 Rewrite</h3>
<span class="cs-tag">Adopted · published</span>
</div>
<span class="field-label">What it did</span>
<p>Consolidated and rewrote the zoning code's foundational chapter. Adopted via Bill 2024-17 and now in force as Chapter 14 of the City's Code of Ordinances.</p>
<span class="field-label">Sources</span>
<div class="src-row"><a href="https://santafenm.gov/Chapter_14_Rewrite-_Phase_1_(bill).pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bill 2024-17 (PDF) ↗</a>
