<article class="card case-study" id="ldc-phase2">
<div class="card-top">
<h3>Phase 2 — roadmap</h3>
<span class="cs-tag">Framework Report not yet public</span>
</div>
<span class="field-label">What's coming, in plain terms</span>
<p><b>Framework Report</b> (targeted Fall 2026, not yet published) — sets the structure the following installments will follow. <b>Installment 1, "How Development is Approved"</b> (2027) — the permitting and review process itself. <b>Installment 2, "How Development is Designed"</b> (2027–2028) — design and dimensional standards. <b>Installment 3, "Where Development Goes"</b> (2028) — the zoning map and allowed-use geography. <b>Installment 4, "Focus Topics"</b> (no date set).</p>
<span class="field-label">Considerations</span>
<p class="muted">None of Phase 2's deliverables are public as of this page's last check. Watch <a href="https://www.santafeldcupdate.org/documents" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the project's document archive ↗</a> directly for the Framework Report; this page will be updated once it's out.</p>
</article>

